+| Main Theorem | **PROMOTE AS CORRECTED, curve-level only** | Exactly Theorem C's scope. It is not an unconditional rank-four campaign closure unless `(C1)` is separately proved for the campaign curve `D_1`. |
+| Noncoprime residual | **OPEN** | Neither Theorem A nor Theorem C currently extends. `(M-INF)` and a valid arm `(ii-a)` or `(ii-b)` remain missing. |
