+ENS 16 (1983), 305–344](https://www.numdam.org/item/ASENS_1983_4_16_2_305_0.pdf).
+It is 4,546,575 bytes and hashes to
+`1b848c19dcaaa016ff8070a7843cfd89db70cbbec3ce13cd9de080074739cc45`, exactly as
