+
+## 7. Residual typing
+
+1. **`(M-INF)` equivalence (charged 558–568) — CONFIRMED with nodal scope retained.**
+   Lemma 4.3 gives
+   `C'^2-2 delta_aff=3d-2-M_infinity`; integrality makes strict positivity equivalent to
